Attribution

  The table is adapted from libretro-database (https://github.com/libretro/libretro-database), (c) the libretro contributors,
  licensed under CC-BY-SA-4.0 (https://github.com/libretro/libretro-database/blob/master/LICENSE). It was made from the files in
  metadat/serial and metadat/redump at commit 77f15a815241163fe4af9631ebce4c3adc954eac.

Changes

  The data was filtered to the platforms this project knows, its product codes were normalised, its titles were shortened to the
  game's name (region, language and revision brackets removed), and rows were merged and sorted. The README in this folder lists
  every change. The script that makes the table is scripts/game-serials/Update-GameSerials.ps1.

